      "post_date": "Tue Jul 17, 2018 1:45 pm",
      "post_datetime": "2018-07-17T18:45:47+00:00",
      "post_subject": "ISDH 2018",
      "content_md": "> **Stevenwrote:↑Mon Jul 16, 2018 9:25 pm:** Have any of the presentations been videoed and made available to the public?I did see a short clip of some holograms being displayed, but that's all.\n\nThere were cameras in the room, hopefully they captured everything. As far as I know, the videos are not available yet. It takes a lot of time if the organizers want to synchronize the video with the slides (as for ISDH 2012 videos, thanks to Kaveh). There are also plans to publish the slides.\n\nYou can take a look at [https://www.facebook.com/isdh2018/](https://www.facebook.com/isdh2018/) for up to date info.\n\nAnyway, you can try to contact the conference staff if they still have some proceedings left.",
